with -1 * offset:

 > coef(glm(counts[,1] ~ covariate, offset=-edaseq.offset[,1], 
family="poisson"))
(Intercept)   covariate
   5.8253511   0.0498681
 > coef(glm(counts[,1] ~ covariate, offset=-cqn.offset[,1], 
family="poisson"))
